WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:23.430
Noa, so you're dead.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:30.170
It's ridiculous that you'd challenge me when you're nothing more than a computer's electic signals.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:35.370
But no matter who stands in my way, I'll defeat them and keep going.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:39.810
Your duel of creation doesn't scare me.

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.210
Fine, Noa.

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:43.470
I accept your duel!

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:50.020
Invincible Deck Master
Shinato's Ark

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.180
Look, Yugi!

00:01:59.180 --> 00:01:59.970
What's that?

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.360
Monsters in the graveyard went into the ark.

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:11.480
What's going on?

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:18.240
My Deck Master, Shinato's Ark, activated one of its abilities: Confinement.

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:19.980
Confinement?

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:27.420
Cards in the graveyard and cards that will go the graveyard will be confined inside the ark.

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:32.860
Seto, Vampire Lord's immortal effect can no longer activate.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:39.370
Seto, watch the seven turns of creation!

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.610
Seven turns of creation?

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:44.830
Will something happen on the 7th turn?

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.880
What's so funny?

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.980
Seven turns of creation?  Whatever.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.890
Your bluff won't work on me.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:03:00.390
Giant Flood discards every monster on the field and in our hands.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.800
Due to its effect, your field is wide open!

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:11.680
We have no monsters in our hands this turn.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:15.270
Whoever draws a monster card first will have the advantage.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:18.280
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:22.380
The goddess of victory is on my side!

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:24.420
Come out, Spear Dragon!

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.790
Attack Noa directly!

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:33.500
You underestimate me.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.200
You think that attack will work?

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.190
What?

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:41.600
I activate Shinato Ark's second Deck Master ability.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.200
Come out, the ark's chosen one!

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:52.710
Vampire Lord!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:57.210
Shinato's Ark's second ability is Absolute Defense.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:02.800
When the Battle Phase begins, for every monster on your field...

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:08.230
...a random monster appears from the ark in defense position.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:24.820
Spear Dragon deals piercing damage.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.880
Kaiba erased some of Noa's life points, but...

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:34.220
If Noa gets a monster for every one of Kaiba's, Kaiba is at a total disadvantage.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.820
The 2nd turn of creation.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:42.770
The ark!

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.330
What's going to happen?

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.000
Look at the water!

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.560
It's disappearing!

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.660
Plants are growing!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.780
The earth is changing!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:05.680
The world has entered the Age of Dinosaurs.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:08.290
I summon Giant Rex!

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:17.290
Giant Rex attacks!

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:32.510
After Spear Dragon attacks, it switches to defense position.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:36.170
Thanks to its effect, you didn't lose any life points.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:44.920
Seto, I told you from the start that I'm superior to you in every way.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:51.590
Ever since I lost my body, I've been living inside that computer.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.760
Inside a computer?

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:56.100
So he is dead.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:03.110
No.  I've resurrected from the edge of death as a being far superior than you can imagine.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:07.400
I was confused at first, but I'm now comfortable.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.220
I'm never bored.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:13.130
Because the human world is full of information.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:19.660
My computer brain can instantly comprehend difficult books...

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:24.130
...or videos that a normal person would take many hours to watch.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:29.550
Therefore, I know everything that mankind knows.

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:35.920
From the birth of the universe to the present day in precise detail.

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:40.720
No human can gain this wisdom.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:47.060
Seto, my mind is far superior to yours.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:54.390
You're just a test my father gave me.  So that I'll be prepared to rule the world.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:57.600
Kaiba is Noa's fake rival?

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:03.220
What's so funny?

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:06.120
Creation and humanity's wisdom.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:10.910
They sound like complaints on a huge scale to me.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:12.920
What?

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:17.410
I don't care what tragedy you faced.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:22.520
No matter what form you take, you're still human.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:28.930
Because you're using all this talk to hide the fact that you're weak.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:35.780
That's something only humans do to escape the truth about themselves!

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.310
You're trying to mess with me with your nonsense.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:40.680
Let me ask you this:

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:50.940
If Gozaburo really wanted you to take over Kaiba Corporation, why didn't he just give it to you?

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:53.260
Why did he make you compete against me?

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:57.000
Why did he choose this complicated path?

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.450
Because...

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.960
You know why.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:07.460
When you were changed into a computer's AI, Gozaburo lost trust in you.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:13.600
Wasn't I in an accident?

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:18.460
Oh!  It was all a dream!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.110
Father!

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.120
Why?

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:30.120
Father!

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:34.200
What?

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:38.800
Father!

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:41.380
Father, please let me out!

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.300
Why not?

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:49.760
Please let me out.

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:52.280
Noa, listen carefully.

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:55.120
You can't get out.

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:59.680
Your body has died.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:02.680
What?

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:06.420
But your mind is alive in there.

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:11.690
I can't touch you, but you are still my son.

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:14.700
I died?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.700
That's a gift from me.

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:23.000
Take care of it.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.460
Father gradually expanded my world.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:35.970
He added data of places that I wanted to visit.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.680
Good morning, Noa.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.250
How are you, Noa?

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:40.020
Hi.

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:43.250
But the world was...

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.340
Hello, Noa.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.940
What would you like?

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.850
Isn't it a nice day?

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.440
Hello, Noa.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.050
What would you like?

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:53.680
Hello, Noa.

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:55.280
What would you like?

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:59.140
The world was slightly off.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.020
Be quiet!  Go away!

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:16.490
Noa, did you like your birthday present?

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:21.660
Yes.  I never thought I could go to outer space.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.450
Father, I wish you could see how blue Earth is-

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:27.100
Oh wait.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:32.510
In order to create this data, you've already seen what I saw.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:37.010
Noa, where's Sunny?

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:41.000
Sunny became violent when I reprogrammed it.

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:42.890
Reprogram?

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:46.700
What's that?

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:49.260
I put on a lock so it won't bite.

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:51.020
This dog's no good.

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:55.200
Its programming is bad, so it does the same thing even after I punish it.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:11:01.100
Father, I did an interesting simulation.

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:10.020
If we use Kaiba Corporation's assets and weapons correctly, we can destroy the world in 30 days.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.510
Bet you didn't know that.

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:12.880
I see...

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:18.770
If that plan succeeds, how many people will survive?

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.080
About 3%.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.280
Isn't that too few?

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.280
I don't care.

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.440
Because it doesn't affect me.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:37.280
I have a great vision for Kaiba Corporation.  When we rule the world, life won't matter.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:41.810
Sounds interesting, but I'll listen some other time.

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:50.480
The Kaiba family adopted you soon after.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:58.500
Since that day, no matter how much knowledge I gained, Father never visited me again.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:03.770
Even Gozaburo couldn't calculate what's on a person's mind.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:08.720
The world you saw was fictional.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:14.280
Human society is the ultimate chaotic world of light and darkness.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:20.780
Only by living in that society can you learn how to survive and grow strong.

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:25.140
Gozaburo was perplexed.  Until he had an idea.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:30.680
To match you up against me - a real person that he could count on.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:41.940
He thought that if you could defeat a real person, he might be able to admit your superiority.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.670
How pathetic.

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:49.680
Inside that cold world, you lost what it means to be human!

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:53.310
Seto, you got it all wrong.

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.680
I haven't lost my human emotions.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:13:00.690
I overcame them to become a creator!

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:04.480
You're a creator because you made this lame world?

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:06.080
You make me laugh!

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:11.060
I'll prove that I understand human emotions.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:14.700
As a creator, I'll make a prediction.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:19.710
On the third turn of creation, you life will be rocked.

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:22.710
Rock my life?

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:25.480
I end my turn.

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:28.220
Brother...

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:49.300
Here I go, Noa!  My turn!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:53.470
The spell card, Pot of Greed!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:58.200
It lets me draw two cards from my deck.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:03.820
Kaiser Sea Horse's Deck Master ability activates!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:08.720
When summoning a Light Attribute monster, I can tribute one fewer monster.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:14.730
So I can summon Level 5 Different Dimension Dragon without tributing.

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:19.500
I set three cards.

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:22.500
I end my turn.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.130
This is bad!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.100
Noa's Giant Rex has 2000 attack points.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:30.510
It'll definitely destroy Kaiba's monster next turn.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:34.510
And if Noa summons another monster, he's finished!

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:36.650
We're talking about Kaiba.

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:40.520
He must have a way to avoid battle by using his set cards.

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:43.530
My turn.  I draw.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:48.300
You're just not good enough to be my opponent.

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:51.530
I'm going to win this turn.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:55.930
I activate the spell card, Deepest Impact.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:03.350
The sky...

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:12.550
Oh no!

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:27.630
Look.  The dust hides the sun, so the world enters the Ice Age.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.560
Noa's monster!

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:42.650
What's with him?  He used his trap card to destroy his own monster!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:51.660
Deepest Impact destroys every monster on the field and cuts are life points in half.

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:55.100
He's not going to attack with his monster?

00:15:56.400 --> 00:16:00.960
I activate the spell card, Ice Age Panic.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:07.170
I can activate this card when there are no monsters on my field.

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:11.680
I can Special Summon an Earth Attribute monster from my deck.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.880
I summon Last Tusk Mammoth!

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:19.690
This is bad!  Kaiba!

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:24.690
Different Dimension Dragon, return to the field!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:35.200
Different Dimension Dragon's effect allows it to fly between dimensions.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:41.960
Non-targeting spell cards don't affect it, and it can't be destroyed in battle.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:47.500
I knew you'd use cards that destroy indiscriminately.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.770
Now you can't attack-

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:49.720
I don't care!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:52.560
Go!  Last Tusk Mammoth!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.960
Attack Different Dimension Dragon!

00:16:56.480 --> 00:17:00.960
He's attacking a monster with greater defense points?

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:05.800
I knew Different Dimension Dragon's effect from the start.

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:10.200
And you know Last Tusk Mammoth's effect also, don't you?

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.590
I see!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:18.480
If you take damage, Last Tusk Mammoth's effect deals the opponent the same amount!

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:21.130
Noa will take 700 points of damage.

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:23.220
And Kaiba has 700 life points!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:25.220
That means Kaiba will lose!

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:29.020
Trap card!

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:30.580
Ring of Destruction!

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:43.820
Ring of Destruction destroys a monster, and we both take damage equal to its attack points.

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:46.070
You destroyed yourself.

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:49.580
I activate my Quick-Play Spell, Ring of Defense!

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:57.680
Well done!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:01.590
Impressive!  He got out of a pinch!

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:02.850
What's wrong, Noa?

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:06.860
Weren't you supposed to be superior to me?

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:10.360
They both have few life points, so the next strike can end them.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.870
But Noa still has a barrier of monsters.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:15.360
My turn.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:18.370
Noa!  I'll finish you this turn!

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:20.870
I look forward to it.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:26.380
I switch Different Dimension Dragon from defense to attack position.

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:30.320
Next, I destroy the Thunder Dragon in my hand.

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:36.020
Thunder Dragon's effect activates!

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:40.030
I add two copies from my deck to my hand!

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:41.710
Fusion Summon!

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.380
Come here, Twin-Headed Thunder Dragon!

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:53.170
2800 attack points!

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:57.410
I activate the spell card, Quick Attack!

00:18:57.640 --> 00:19:02.410
It allows my Fusion Monster to attack this turn!

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:06.020
Get all the monsters you want.  It's pointless.

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:09.740
Come out, chosen ones!

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.740
Noa's monsters are back!

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.020
It's no good.

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:25.740
That seals my victory, Noa!

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:30.140
Your Deck Master is powerful and invincible.

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:33.800
But my dueling is superior.

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:36.610
This is the final trap I set for you!

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:39.620
I activate Dragon's Rage!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:44.130
Dragon's Rage's effect.

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:52.150
When the attacking monster is stronger than the defender, you take the difference as damage.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:55.170
Go!  Different Dimension Dragon!

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:57.370
Attack Giant Rex!

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:09.480
All right!

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:12.350
Kaiba will win if he destroys one more monster!

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:15.090
Vanish, Noa.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.220
Twin-Headed Thunder Dragon!

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:19.680
Attack Giant Soldier of St-

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:20.580
Stop!

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:28.210
Mokuba!

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:29.520
Mokuba!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:33.500
I won't forgive anyone who hurts my brother.

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:35.610
Mokuba!  You...

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:38.110
Why's he saying that?

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:44.500
Yes.  Save me, Mokuba.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.120
He's the one who bullies me.

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:48.800
He's our enemy.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:49.880
Enemy...

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:51.490
How dare you...

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:59.510
By sealing his tragic memories, he loves me as his brother.

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:02.300
Mokuba wants to protect me.

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:05.000
Mokuba is my brother.

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:08.360
Come on, Seto.

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:11.480
You can defeat me with one attack.

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:14.020
It's all up to you.

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:17.080
Blow me and Mokuba away!

00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:24.760
I did predict that your life would be rocked this turn.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:28.990
Noa knew this would happen?

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:35.000
Hurry up and attack, Seto!

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:47.960
Mokuba suddenly stepped in front of Kaiba to protect Noa.

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:50.510
This is what Noa predicted?

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:56.760
It's the perfect chance to defeat Noa, but Kaiba can't attack Mokuba.

00:21:56.760 --> 00:22:01.120
Kaiba stops attacking, and Noa torments him.

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:02.560
Survive, Kaiba!

00:22:02.560 --> 00:22:06.280
There must be a way to regain Mokuba's memories!

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:10.080
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Save Mokuba!
7th Turn of Destiny

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:11.620
Duel, standby!

00:22:14.420 --> 00:22:22.320
The sun never sets
It rises forever

